## Components Used

### Core Hardware
- Microcontroller- 2 ESP 32
- IMU Sensor- MPU9250
- Servo Motors- TowerPro MG996R (180 Degree)
- Pan-Tilt Mount (mechanical structure for turret movement)  

### Communication Module (any one)
- I used ESP-now
- Can also use NRF24L01 RF Module  


### Power System
- 5V regulated power supply (for microcontroller)  
- External power source for servos (battery pack or adapter)  

### Supporting Components
- PCB  
- Jumper wires  
- Resistors and capacitors (for signal stability and filtering)  
- Switch (power control)  
